*> PROGRAM : PEN0028
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-03-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 587
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0028.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0028C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CALC-LATE-FEE
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
CALC-LATE-FEE.
    EVALUATE IN-DAYS-LATE
        *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN 1 THRU 15
            MOVE 15 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN 16 THRU 45
            MOVE 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
        WHEN 46 THRU 999
            COMPUTE LATE-CHARGE = IN-STMT-DUE-AMT * 0.05
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
